+   $$ mn = v_0, \quad mx = v_0 $$
+2. **Iteration:** Loop through each remaining vertex $v_i$ for $i$ from 1 to $n-1$.
+3. **Update Bounds:** For each dimension $d \in \{0, 1, 2\}$ (corresponding to X, Y, Z):
+   $$ mn_d = \min(v_i[d], mn_d) $$
+   $$ mx_d = \max(v_i[d], mx_d) $$
 
